OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 21 Oct to Fri 30 OctFIt
OL,6,Fis looking increasingly likely that a
OL,7,Fchangeable if not unsettled spell of
OL,8,Fweather will affect the UK through
OL,9,Fthis period, with spells of wet and
OL,10,Fwindy weather arriving from the
OL,11,FAtlantic followed by drier though
OL,12,Fstill showery interludes. While there
OL,13,Fis still a chance that high pressure
OL,14,Fwill build near the UK again during
OL,15,Flate October, it is more likely that
OL,16,Fthe changeable or unsettled regime
OL,17,Fwill continue once established. It is
OL,18,Fpossible that stormy weather may also
OL,19,Fdevelop at times. Temperatures are
OL,20,Flikely to be near or a little above
OL,21,Fnormal overall, with mild spells
OL,22,Flikely at times, especially towards
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fthe south. In between frontal systems,
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fcolder nights are possible, with a
OL,25,Ftouch of frost.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
PN,16303
