PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1792158960
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G3/3
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 31 Oct to Sat 14 Nov
OL,6,FThis period is highly uncertain, more
OL,7,Fso than normal, but overall it seems
OL,8,Fmore likely than not that weather
OL,9,Fpatterns will be dominated by westerly
OL,10,For southwesterly winds from the
OL,11,FAtlantic during this period. This will
OL,12,Fresult in occasional spells of wet and
OL,13,Fwindy weather followed by drier but
OL,14,Fstill showery interludes. High
OL,15,Fpressure may attempt to build across
OL,16,Fthe country at times but any settled
OL,17,Fspells are most likely to be short-
OL,18,Flived. Temperatures are likely to be
OL,19,Fnear or above average overall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
